Files: layer-shell-qt/*
Copyright: 2021-2026 Aleix Pol Gonzalez and the KDE contributors
           2018 Drew DeVault
License: LGPL-2.1 or LGPL-3 or LicenseRef-KDE-Accepted-LGPL
Comment: The licence of the library, the shell integration plugin and the
 QML module (REUSE headers; LICENSES/ in the component folder lists every
 licence of the folder). Its CMake files are BSD-3-Clause and the
 wlr-layer-shell protocol XML is MIT (Expat).

Files: omasnap/*
Copyright: 2026 Tobi Lütke
           2026 Lucide Icons and Contributors
License: Expat and ISC
Comment: Expat for omasnap itself (LICENSE). omasnap ships the ISC licence
 of the Lucide icons as assets/Lucide-ISC.txt, installed as
 /usr/share/doc/motanka-stack-shell/omasnap/Lucide-ISC.txt.

Files: omasnap/assets/Neucha.ttf
Copyright: 2008-2010 Jovanny Lemonad
License: OFL-1.1
